     "$T^2(x,y,z)=(x+2y+z,\\,y+z,\\,0)$;$\\ker T^2=\\ker T=\\mathrm{span}\\{(1,-1,1)\\}$,$\\mathrm{im}\\,T^2=\\mathrm{im}\\,T=\\{(a,b,0)\\}$。"
